      <section class="case-detail-grid">
        <div class="bullet-panel">
          <h2 class="en">Strategy & Execution</h2>
          <h2 class="zh">策略与执行</h2>
          <ul class="en">
            <li>Clarified the role of each page type, including blogs, collection pages, product pages, trust pages, and revenue-driving pages.</li>
            <li>Improved website content structure so users could move from information search to product discovery and purchase.</li>
            <li>Optimized collection pages and selected product pages with keyword-based naming, titles, descriptions, copy, images, and internal links.</li>
            <li>Audited indexation, crawlability, sitemap, canonical, redirects, duplicate content, schema, Core Web Vitals, and Shopify SEO issues.</li>
            <li>Reviewed technical findings, prioritized issues, and communicated implementation needs with developers.</li>
            <li>Built backlinks, short-form content, and PR-style content to strengthen authority, brand exposure, and referral traffic.</li>
            <li>Responded to a major organic visibility decline by reviewing affected content patterns, refining page roles, and helping daily GSC clicks return to approximately 100.</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="zh">
            <li>明确博客、集合页、产品页、信任页和收入页面在网站中的角色和责任。</li>
            <li>优化网站内容结构，让用户能从信息搜索自然进入产品发现和购买路径。</li>
            <li>优化集合页和部分产品页，包括关键词命名、标题、描述、页面文案、图片和内链。</li>
            <li>审计收录、抓取、sitemap、canonical、redirect、重复内容、schema、Core Web Vitals 和 Shopify SEO 问题。</li>
            <li>评估技术检测结果，整理优先级，并与开发沟通落地。</li>
            <li>通过外链文章、短文和 PR 类型内容增强网站 authority、品牌曝光和自然流量。</li>
            <li>在自然搜索可见度大幅下降后，排查受影响内容模式、细化页面角色，并帮助 GSC 日均点击恢复至约 100 次。</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="case-note en">GA4 recorded $265,788.78 in Organic Search revenue from November 1, 2025 to July 31, 2026, alongside a separately measured 52.51% recent organic-revenue increase. From May 18 to July 31, 2026, the dedicated GSC Generative AI performance report recorded 50.7K impressions. The site also passed Core Web Vitals assessment.</p>
          <p class="case-note zh">2025 年 11 月 1 日至 2026 年 7 月 31 日期间，GA4 记录的 Organic Search 收入为 265,788.78 美元；另一可比周期的近期自然搜索收入增幅为 52.51%。2026 年 5 月 18 日至 7 月 31 日期间，GSC Generative AI performance report 记录了 50.7K 次展示，网站同时通过了 Core Web Vitals 评估。</p>
